<title>CHINA: Pusan Bank launches US$60 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Pusan Bank launches US$60 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner BA Asia on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PUSAN BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$60 MLN  COUPON     3ML+50BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 ANNUAL **   CALLS     ANNUAL ** PAY DATE  25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET    PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p> RATING     BAA1 *     SALES LMTS CUSTOMARY DENOMS    US$100K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	  CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  S.KOREA   TAXATION  FREE&amp;CLR</p>
<p> FEES	 12.5BP FLAT FOR MANAGEMENT AND UNDERWRITING</p>
<p> ARRANGER   BA ASIA (BOOKS)</p>
<p>PAY AGENT  BANKERS TRUST CO'S HONGKONG BRANCH</p>
<p> NOTES	*ISSUER RATING</p>
<p>	     **PUT AND CALL OPTIONS ON THE INTEREST PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p>		 FALLING IN JULY 1998 AND JULY 1999.</p>
<p>		 DIRECT, UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED AND UNCONDITIONAL</p>
<p>		 DEBTS, RANKED PARI PASSU.</p>
<p>		 A GROUP IS BEING FORMED.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
